{"id":1695,"date":"2025-11-19T17:18:34","date_gmt":"2025-11-19T09:18:34","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/?p=1695"},"modified":"2026-02-06T15:26:12","modified_gmt":"2026-02-06T07:26:12","slug":"vulcan-shield-global-to-establish-high-tech-alumina-fiber-manufacturing-plant-in-bekescsaba-hungary","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/vulcan-shield-global-to-establish-high-tech-alumina-fiber-manufacturing-plant-in-bekescsaba-hungary\/","title":{"rendered":"Vulcan Shield Global to Establish High-Tech Alumina Fiber Manufacturing Plant in B\u00e9k\u00e9scsaba, Hungary"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"1695\" class=\"elementor elementor-1695\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-99f263d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"99f263d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6082def e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6082def\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;full&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3261669 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"3261669\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 28-02-2024 *\/\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"800\" src=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/bekescsaba-min-819x1024.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1697\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/bekescsaba-min-819x1024.png 819w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/bekescsaba-min-240x300.png 240w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/bekescsaba-min-768x960.png 768w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/bekescsaba-min.png 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1d261dc e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1d261dc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;full&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-097b761 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"097b761\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 28-02-2024 *\/\n.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-stacked .elementor-drop-cap{background-color:#69727d;color:#fff}.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-framed .elementor-drop-cap{color:#69727d;border:3px solid;background-color:transparent}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap{margin-top:8px}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap-letter{width:1em;height:1em}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap{float:left;text-align:center;line-height:1;font-size:50px}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap-letter{display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t<p>We are pleased to announce that Vulcan Shield Global is moving forward with a major strategic investment in Europe: the development of a state-of-the-art alumina fiber manufacturing facility in B\u00e9k\u00e9scsaba, Hungary.<\/p><p id=\"ember667\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">This new site will support Europe\u2019s growing demand for advanced materials, particularly in high-temperature and high-performance applications where alumina fiber plays a critical role. Continuous alumina fiber textiles and yarn production will begin next year, with full fiber capabilities scheduled for completion in 2027.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2d3f15d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2d3f15d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Alumina fiber is a key enabling material for next-generation Ceramic Matrix Composites (CMCs) used across a wide range of sectors, including:<o:p><\/o:p><\/p><ul style=\"margin-top: 0in;\" type=\"disc\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\">Aerospace \u2013 thermal-resistant structural components and CMC reinforcement<o:p><\/o:p><\/li><li class=\"MsoNormal\">Automotive \u2013 high-temperature parts for EVs and advanced engine systems<o:p><\/o:p><\/li><li class=\"MsoNormal\">Communications \u2013 materials with excellent radio-wave permeability paired with high modulus<o:p><\/o:p><\/li><li class=\"MsoNormal\">Electronics \u2013 components requiring thermal stability and insulation performance<o:p><\/o:p><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2c5085a e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"2c5085a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3d34b65 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3d34b65\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Beyond its industrial impact, the project will deliver substantial economic value to the region. Once fully operational, the plant is expected to create multiple job opportunities across production, engineering, and support functions. We will also partner closely with local universities and research institutes to foster innovation and develop a strong technical talent pipeline.<o:p><\/o:p><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">This investment represents our long-term commitment to strengthening Europe\u2019s advanced-materials ecosystem while ensuring a resilient, secure, and forward-looking supply chain for oxide continuous fibers.<o:p><\/o:p><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">More updates will follow as development progresses.<o:p><\/o:p><\/p><ul style=\"margin-top: 0in;\" type=\"disc\"><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We are pleased to announce that Vulcan Shield Global is moving forward with a major strategic investment in Europe: the development of a state-of-the-art alumina fiber manufacturing facility in B\u00e9k\u00e9scsaba, Hungary. This new site will support Europe\u2019s growing demand for advanced materials, particularly in high-temperature and high-performance applications where alumina fiber plays a critical role. [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":1747,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_monsterinsights_skip_tracking":false,"cybocfi_hide_featured_image":"","footnotes":"","_links_to":"","_links_to_target":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-1695","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-